{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/967188-more-help-for-bob","id":967188,"title":"More help for Bob","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-10T22:50:22-07:00","id":967188,"title":"More help for Bob","content":"Fellow Willworkers,<br /> <br /> Here's Bob....(and his kinda lost player) hoping you will again help with spellcasting.. Path : Thyrsus, Order : Adamantine Arrow, Concept : Combat Medic<br /> <br /> Stats<br /> <br /> Int. 3, Wits 3, Resolve 2<br /> <br /> Str. 2, Dex. 2, Sta. 2<br /> <br /> Pre. 2, Man. 2, Composure 4 (bonus composure included)<br /> <br /> Skills<br /> <br /> Academics 2, computer 1, investigation 2, medicine 3 (spec. First Aid), occult 3 (bonus included), science 1<br /> <br /> Athletics 2 (spec.acrobatics), Drive 1, Firearms 2 (spec. pistols), stealth 2<br /> <br /> Persuasion 1, socialize 1, intimidate 1, subterfuge 1<br /> <br /> Arcana<br /> <br /> Life 3, Prime 1, Space 1, Spirit 1<br /> <br /> Rotes <br /> <br /> <br /> Honing the form (life 3)<br /> Supernal Vision (prime 1)<br /> The outward and Inward Eye (space 1)<br /> Exorcist's Eye (spirit 1)<br /> <br /> NOW The questions.....<br /> <br /> Bob wants to make Body control (life 2) as one of his praxes (bob has Gnosis 2) can he do it or do i have to take one of the above rotes as my praxes?<br /> <br /> Does Bob get reaches for any spell he improvises? or for that matter his praxes??<br /> <br /> is the following correct...<br /> <br /> Bob improvising a life 1 spell...Dice (gnosis+life)(5)+(Yantra high speech)(+2), (Yantra Magic tool) (+1) Base dice 8 before penalties.<br /> <br /> Thank you all....BTW anyone in Seattle area that i might be able to game with???<br /> <br /> Raphael<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12391-rtemplar","name":"rtemplar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-10T23:51:13-07:00","id":967204,"title":"","content":"As I understand it, any spell can be your praxis, so yes body control is ok as a praxis.<br /> <br /> Ues, you always get reach. One reach and one extra for every level of arcana above what you need for the spell. The exception is rotes where you get reach as if you have 5 in the arcanum.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7463-toine","name":"Toine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7463_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T00:41:23-07:00","id":967224,"title":"","content":"Praxis and rotes are unrelated things. In fact it's kinda useless to have a spell as both a Rote and a Praxis as you can't combine the bonuses they provide on the same casting.<br /> <br /> You always get Reach when casting spells and the amount you get is equal to (YourArcanumDots - TheSpellsDots)+1. When you cast the spell as a rote you treat YourArcanumDots as 5 for purpouses of calculating Reach.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2636-menace","name":"Menace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2636_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"527"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-11T06:46:51-07:00","id":967285,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't say useless. It's just very situational. There are some spells that can be used two very different ways (such as Bolster Spirit which can buff or heal) which might benefit better from a Praxis in some situations and a Rote in others. Though such situations are rare and the benefit of being able to choose might not be enough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1692-maina","name":"Maina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1692_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"724"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}